  m_Name: Story_yuki
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: yuki
  title: The Wetland Room
  summary: 'Yuki is precise and quietly funny. Her new exhibition is about the valley before the city, and the museum''s new sponsor, Sterling, wants it rewritten. Fork: open it honestly and lose the sponsor, or move it to a free pop-up museum in the suburb.'
  pathAName: The honest exhibition
  pathBName: The pop-up museum
  parts:
  - title: First look
    number: 1
    heartsNeeded: 1
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Good day. You have not dug up anything interesting yet? Never mind. You will. Old farms always give something back eventually.
    - When you do, I would like to see it first. Before Grace. Grace will want to write about it. I want to put it in a glass case and light it properly.
    happy: 0
