    pages:
    - Frank's sign is still crooked. Two degrees to the left. I measured it last Monday with a protractor while pretending to tie my shoe.
    - I have not said anything. It is the hardest thing I have ever not done.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
